          class="text-dark desktop:text-left smalldesktop:text-left mobile:text-left tablet:text-left opacity-50"
        >
          Software design and software development aren’t two different
          disciplines. They are the same discipline grotesquely chopped into two
          halves leaving us with poorly designed, buggy and inelegant software.
        </h3>
        <h3
          class="text-dark italic desktop:text-left smalldesktop:text-left mobile:text-left mt-5 tablet:text-left humana-gradient text-dark/0 bg-clip-text font-bold"
