        </h3>
        <div class="divider-light my-16"></div> -->
        <h3
          class="text-dark desktop:text-left smalldesktop:text-left mobile:text-left mt-16 tablet:text-left"
        >
          <span class="opacity-50"> I’m Alan Christian, </span><span
            class="humana-gradient text-dark/0 bg-clip-text font-bold"
            >a digital product designer & web developer</span
          >
          <span class="opacity-50">
            based in Stockholm, Sweden. Currently, I'm at the verge of
            completion of my masters in Human-Computer Interaction from Uppsala
            University.</span
          >

          <br
            class="mobile:hidden tablet:hidden desktop:block smalldesktop:block"
          />
          <!-- <span class="humana-gradient text-dark/0 bg-clip-text"
              >human.</span
            > -->
        <!-- </h3> -->

        <h3
          class="text-dark desktop:text-left smalldesktop:text-left mobile:text-left mt-10 tablet:text-left opacity-50"
        >
          Previously, I have worked for companies like Surfboard Payments and
          2adpro (now a part of Delloite Digital). My experience in the field of
          UX is diverse. Throughout my career I have focused on creating
          delightful user interfaces that create positive business impact.
        </h3>
